  "ruleText": "Rev 3202.02 Filing of ED-01, Scholarship Organization Application. Except as provided in Rev 3202.01(c), Form ED-01 shall be considered timely if filed with the department no later than June 15 of each program year.\n\nSource. #10236, eff 11-28-12; amd by #12881, eff 9-27-19; ss by #13462, eff 10-13-22 (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 3200)",
